{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ultimate 2D Shooter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rat with an assault rifle? How about a rat with <i>TWENTY</i> guns \u2014 including shotguns, energy weapons, grenade launchers, an overpowered harpoon gun, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/extras/gungif2.gif?t=1748501093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Epic Spells and Perks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guns not enough? That\u2019s fair. That\u2019s why GAT RAT can also wield elemental spells and game-changing perks that completely transform your playstyle into something wild and overpowered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/extras/spellgif2.gif?t=1748501093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Pixel Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot your way through 9 vastly different realms, each packed with multiple levels, unique enemies, and intense boss fights \u2014 all rendered in beautiful pixel art, just waiting to be destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAT RAT Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20 guns</strong>, each with their own feel and strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>8 unique spells</strong> to excel in different scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>15 perks</strong> to turn GAT RAT into the ultimate shooter. (Or spellcaster. Or brick wall.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect loot</strong> from slain enemies, and return to your hideout to upgrade your gear and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 vastly different realms</strong>, each with multiple levels of their own, complete with a massive variety of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique boss fights</strong> that each require their own strategy to beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful, immersive pixel art</strong> for every world and enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaderboards</strong> for fastest boss clears and\u00a0lifetime collected loot \u2014 build the best loadout and show everyone who the greatest is.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661740?t=1748501093","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661740?t=1748501093","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/993aae5f6974396bb8d9452d2e18aba087a6aedf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748501093","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/993aae5f6974396bb8d9452d2e18aba087a6aedf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748501093","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3728510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ultimate 2D Shooter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rat with an assault rifle? How about a rat with <i>TWENTY</i> guns \u2014 including shotguns, energy weapons, grenade launchers, an overpowered harpoon gun, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740